	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10857"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=835" title="View the profile of Keyes">Keyes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=835"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1071.msg10857#msg10857"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1071.msg10857#msg10857">Re: Middle-tier guilds?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> September 06, 2004, 02:04:10 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hmm, being just a relatively new member of Apothoesis.&nbsp; I haven&#039;t found anyone in the guild who has bad mouthed any other guild.&nbsp; Most of us have friends and/or family members in other guilds.&nbsp; <br /><br />Yes, the competition for mobs is still an issue but every guild who is flagged for the higher teirs has the same problems (3 zones and 8 to 10 guilds flagged for the zones).&nbsp; <br /><br />I don&#039;t know why Apotheosis was singled out with Ruination but Qadain our GL has been very even handed and runs a tight guild.&nbsp; <br /><br />Find some other guild to use to create &quot;drama&quot;.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
